  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Delivering food to Colombia&apos;s neediest communities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Imagine living in a remote community without access to resources to maintain proper nutrition and struggling every day to get food and survive. Sadly, this is a reality for many families around the world.  At PAN, our mission is to improve the quality of life of these people by providing more than 5,000 nutritional packages every month to children and families living in remote communities. Our purpose is to ensure that every person has the right to access food.</narrative>
  </description>
